  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>r</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "NsGpl",
      "text": "Is independent of both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
