  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>r</mi></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Since, the second and the third rows are independent of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;hence the sum is applied to the first row only.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mi>r</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">=</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">=</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are identical<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Hence, the sum is independent of both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
